    summary: "This final session reviews the course and sends learners out. Using Micah 6:8, Isaiah 61:1-3, Luke 4:18-19 and Galatians 6:9-10, it gathers the main lessons: God's justice and mercy, human dignity, care for widows, orphans, the poor, strangers, the sick, children, women and prisoners, resisting oppression and injustice, advocacy without partisanship and sustaining compassion. Learners write commitments and are commissioned.",
    scripture: ["Isaiah 61:1-3", "Galatians 6:9-10"], more: ["Micah 6:8", "Luke 4:18-19", "Matthew 25:40"], memory: "Galatians 6:9",
