    apply: "Write your personal covenant and share it with a trusted friend or leader. Join a team or project to keep serving. Teach one lesson to someone else. Memorise Galatians 6:9. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
